<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00617">
	<title>Stop</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>If the vehicle stops by <uicontrol>Emergency Stop</uicontrol>, a warning message, warning sounds, and hazard warning flashers will alert if <uicontrol>Emergency Stop</uicontrol> is operated.</p>
		<p>After that, the vehicle will automatically operate the following procedures:</p>
		<ul id="e03860">
			<li>
				<p>Door unlock</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p><term translate="no">SOS</term> Call connect</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p><term translate="no">EPB</term> applied</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Shift to the P (Park) position.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00614.dita#t00614" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Emergency Stop operation</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>